# Play test of Driftcloud Islet (CIPlay driftcloud_islet, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (55 m up; heights
# count from the island's own water line). No quest: the meadow, the lean-to's chest, down to the nesting ledge and up
# its ladder. Points as in its recipe.
island Driftcloud Islet
offset 0 0
wait 3
at 0 -2
expect height 6
at -1.5 -0.5 h=6
open Chest under the lean-to
at 2 -9.8
expect height 3.6
climb 2 -8.15 h=3.6
